<title>USA: Marshalltown sales rejected by Fed.</title>
<headline>Marshalltown sales rejected by Fed.</headline>
<dateline>MARSHALLTOWN, Iowa 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marshalltown Financial Corp said Tuesday the Federal Reserve Board has rejected its planned acquisition by BancSecurity Corp, saying the deal would create undue market concentration in Marshall County, Iowa.</p>
<p>Marshalltown said it will instruct its financial advisor to explore other alternatives to enhance shareholder value.  </p>
<p>The Fed's decision resulted in the termination of the agreement to merge the two bank holding companies, under which Marshalltown shareholders were to have received $24.7 million.</p>
<p>Marshalltown shares fell 3/4 to 14-1/2.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
